{
  "id": "spanly",
  "name": "Spanly — Time Span Selector",
  "subtitle": "Radial Dial & Linear Slider",
  "category_badge": "📦 Android Library",
  "icon_dark": "icon_dark.svg",
  "icon_light": "icon_light.svg",
  "banner_dark": "spanly_logo_horizontal_dark.svg",
  "banner_light": "spanly_logo_horizontal_light.svg",
  "aliases": [
    "timespanselectorview",
    "TimeSpanSelectorView"
  ],
  "type": "library",
  "order": 50,
  "published": true,
  "tagline": "A high-performance, elegant Time Span Selector library for Android with Radial Dial and Linear Slider controls.",
  "description": "<p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--mut); margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.65;\">\n  <b>Spanly</b> is the official high-performance, Material 3-ready Time Span Selector library for Android. It provides both <b>SpanlyDial</b> (radial clock dial) and <b>SpanlySlider</b> (linear timeline slider) UI controls for shift planning, alarm configuration, appointment booking, sleep tracking, and duration selection.\n</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">🌟 Key Capabilities &amp; Features</h2>\n\n<div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <img src=\"assets/spanly_demo_preview.svg\" alt=\"Spanly Dual Controls\" style=\"width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">🕒 Dual Controls (SpanlyDial &amp; SpanlySlider)</div>\n    <p>Includes both circular clock dial and linear timeline slider widgets with precision handle touch targets and snap intervals.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <img src=\"assets/overnight_support.svg\" alt=\"Overnight Support\" style=\"width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">🌓 Overnight Spans</div>\n    <p>Native support for spans crossing midnight (e.g. 10:00 PM – 06:00 AM) without range wrapping glitches or complex code hacks.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">🚫 Blocked Time Intervals</div>\n    <p>Highlight unavailable, reserved, or busy time slots on the selector track using <code>addBlockedInterval(start, end, color)</code>.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">↔️ Whole-Span Window Dragging</div>\n    <p>Allow users to drag the entire selected time window along the track while keeping the duration intact, or shift programmatically with <code>shiftSpan(minutes)</code>.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">🎨 Custom Gradients &amp; Thumb Styling</div>\n    <p>Apply multi-color gradients to active tracks (<code>setSpanGradientColors</code>) and assign custom drawables, tinting, or drop shadows to thumb handles.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">⏱️ Snap Intervals &amp; Duration Bounds</div>\n    <p>Snap thumbs to 1, 5, 15, 30, or custom minute steps (<code>tss_thumbMinuteStep</code>) and enforce minimum/maximum span duration bounds.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">📦 1. Installation &amp; Dependency Setup</h2>\n\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>build.gradle.kts (App Module)</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-kw\">dependencies</span> {\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">implementation</span>(<span class=\"hl-str\">\"io.github.ervivekumrao:spanly:1.0.0\"</span>)\n}</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>settings.gradle.kts (Repositories)</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-kw\">dependencyResolutionManagement</span> {\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">repositories</span> {\n        <span class=\"hl-func\">mavenCentral</span>()\n        <span class=\"hl-func\">maven</span> { url = <span class=\"hl-func\">uri</span>(<span class=\"hl-str\">\"https://jitpack.io\"</span>) }\n    }\n}</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">🛠️ 2. XML Layout Integration</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">A. SpanlyDial (Circular Clock Dial)</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>res/layout/activity_dial.xml</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code>&lt;<span class=\"hl-tag\">umrao.spanly.SpanlyDial</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">android:id</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"@+id/spanlyDial\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">android:layout_width</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"320dp\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">android:layout_height</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"320dp\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanStartInMinutes</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"510\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanEndInMinutes</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"1020\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_thumbMinuteStep</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"15\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_allowOvernightSpan</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"true\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_is24HourFormat</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"false\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanColor</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"#6366F1\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_trackColor</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"#334155\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanTextPosition</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"center\"</span> /&gt;</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">B. SpanlySlider (Linear Timeline Slider)</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>res/layout/activity_slider.xml</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code>&lt;<span class=\"hl-tag\">umrao.spanly.SpanlySlider</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">android:id</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"@+id/spanlySlider\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">android:layout_width</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"match_parent\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">android:layout_height</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"wrap_content\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanStartTime</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"08:30\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanEndTime</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"17:00\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_thumbMinuteStep</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"15\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanColor</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"#06B6D4\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_trackColor</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"#334155\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hl-attr\">app:tss_spanTextPosition</span>=<span class=\"hl-str\">\"bottom\"</span> /&gt;</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">📋 3. Complete XML Attributes Reference</h2>\n\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\">\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; font-size: 0.92rem;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brd); color: var(--fg);\">\n        <th style=\"padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\">XML Attribute</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\">Format / Enum</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\">Default</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\">Description</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody style=\"color: var(--mut);\">\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_spanStartInMinutes</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">integer</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>540</code> (09:00)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Start time in minutes from midnight (0–1439).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_spanEndInMinutes</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">integer</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>1020</code> (17:00)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">End time in minutes from midnight (0–1439).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_spanStartTime</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">string|reference</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>null</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Start time as formatted string (e.g. <code>\"08:30\"</code> or <code>\"8:30 AM\"</code>).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_spanEndTime</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">string|reference</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>null</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">End time as formatted string (e.g. <code>\"17:00\"</code> or <code>\"5:00 PM\"</code>).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_thumbMinuteStep</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">integer</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>15</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Handle drag snap interval in minutes (1, 5, 15, 30, etc.).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_allowOvernightSpan</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">boolean</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>true</code> (Dial)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Allow selected span to cross midnight (e.g., 22:00 to 06:00).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_is24HourFormat</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">boolean</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>true</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Toggle 24-hour vs 12-hour AM/PM clock display.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_minDurationMinutes</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">integer</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>0</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Minimum allowed span duration in minutes.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_maxDurationMinutes</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">integer</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>1440</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Maximum allowed span duration in minutes.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_spanColor</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">color</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>?attr/colorPrimary</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Color of the active selected time span arc/bar.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_trackColor</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">color</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>DKGRAY</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Color of the inactive background track.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_startThumbDrawable</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">reference</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>null</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Custom drawable handle icon for start time thumb.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_endThumbDrawable</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">reference</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>null</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Custom drawable handle icon for end time thumb.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd);\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>tss_spanTextPosition</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">top|bottom|center</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\"><code>center</code></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;\">Relative position of the span info text display.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">💻 4. Programmatic API &amp; Event Listeners</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">A. Setting &amp; Reading Selection Programmatically</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>MainActivity.kt (Programmatic Control)</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-kw\">val</span> dial = <span class=\"hl-func\">findViewById</span>&lt;<span class=\"hl-type\">SpanlyDial</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hl-type\">R</span>.id.spanlyDial)\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Set time in minutes from midnight (08:30 AM to 05:00 PM)</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">setSpanInMinutes</span>(<span class=\"hl-num\">510</span>, <span class=\"hl-num\">1020</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Set time using formatted strings</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">setSpanTime</span>(<span class=\"hl-str\">\"08:30\"</span>, <span class=\"hl-str\">\"17:00\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Working with domain model TimeSpan</span>\n<span class=\"hl-kw\">val</span> currentSpan: <span class=\"hl-type\">TimeSpan</span> = dial.timeSpan\n<span class=\"hl-type\">Log</span>.<span class=\"hl-func\">d</span>(<span class=\"hl-str\">\"Spanly\"</span>, <span class=\"hl-str\">\"Start: \"</span> + currentSpan.startMinutes + <span class=\"hl-str\">\", End: \"</span> + currentSpan.endMinutes + <span class=\"hl-str\">\", Overnight: \"</span> + currentSpan.isOvernight)\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Read total duration in minutes</span>\n<span class=\"hl-kw\">val</span> durationMins: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span> = dial.durationInMinutes</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">B. Event Listeners</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>Listeners.kt</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-com\">// Real-Time Span Change Listener</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">setOnSpanChangeListener</span>(<span class=\"hl-kw\">object</span> : <span class=\"hl-type\">ISpanly.OnSpanChangeListener</span> {\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onSpanChanged</span>(startMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>, endMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>, isOvernight: <span class=\"hl-type\">Boolean</span>) {\n        <span class=\"hl-com\">// Updated continuously as user drags handles</span>\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onInteractionFinished</span>(startMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>, endMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>, isOvernight: <span class=\"hl-type\">Boolean</span>) {\n        <span class=\"hl-com\">// Triggered when touch interaction releases</span>\n    }\n})\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Granular Time Change Listener</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">setOnTimeChangeListener</span>(<span class=\"hl-kw\">object</span> : <span class=\"hl-type\">ISpanly.OnTimeChangeListener</span> {\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onStartTimeChange</span>(startTimeMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>) {}\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onEndTimeChange</span>(endTimeMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>) {}\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onDurationChange</span>(startTimeMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>, endTimeMinutes: <span class=\"hl-type\">Int</span>) {}\n})\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Thumb Drag Interception</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">setOnDragChangeListener</span>(<span class=\"hl-kw\">object</span> : <span class=\"hl-type\">ISpanly.OnDragChangeListener</span> {\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onDragStart</span>(thumb: <span class=\"hl-type\">ISpanly.Thumb</span>): <span class=\"hl-type\">Boolean</span> {\n        <span class=\"hl-com\">// Return true to allow drag, false to disallow</span>\n        <span class=\"hl-kw\">return true</span>\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"hl-kw\">override fun</span> <span class=\"hl-func\">onDragStop</span>(thumb: <span class=\"hl-type\">ISpanly.Thumb</span>) {}\n})</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">🚀 5. Advanced Features</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">A. Blocked Time Intervals</h3>\n<p style=\"color: var(--mut); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Render busy or reserved time slots directly on the track:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>BlockedSlots.kt</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-com\">// Block 12:00 PM to 01:00 PM (Lunch Break) in RED</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">addBlockedInterval</span>(<span class=\"hl-num\">720</span>, <span class=\"hl-num\">780</span>, <span class=\"hl-type\">Color</span>.RED)\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Clear all blocked slots</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">clearBlockedIntervals</span>()</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">B. Whole-Span Window Dragging &amp; Shifting</h3>\n<p style=\"color: var(--mut); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Allow users to slide the whole selection along the track or shift programmatically:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>SpanDragging.kt</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-com\">// Enable whole-span dragging</span>\ndial.isSpanDraggingAllowed = <span class=\"hl-kw\">true</span>\n\n<span class=\"hl-com\">// Shift entire selected window forward by 30 minutes</span>\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">shiftSpan</span>(<span class=\"hl-num\">30</span>)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;\">C. Custom Gradient Tracks</h3>\n<p style=\"color: var(--mut); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Apply multi-color linear or radial track gradients:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\">\n  <div class=\"code-header\">\n    <div class=\"code-header-dots\">\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-red\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n      <span class=\"code-header-dot dot-green\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span>Gradients.kt</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"code-content\"><code><span class=\"hl-kw\">val</span> colors = <span class=\"hl-func\">intArrayOf</span>(<span class=\"hl-type\">Color</span>.<span class=\"hl-func\">parseColor</span>(<span class=\"hl-str\">\"#6366F1\"</span>), <span class=\"hl-type\">Color</span>.<span class=\"hl-func\">parseColor</span>(<span class=\"hl-str\">\"#06B6D4\"</span>))\ndial.<span class=\"hl-func\">setSpanGradientColors</span>(colors)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;\">🧩 6. Data Models &amp; Utilities</h2>\n\n<div class=\"grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">TimeSpan</div>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--mut);\">Immutable domain model representing a time span selection with <code>startMinutes</code>, <code>endMinutes</code>, and <code>isOvernight</code>.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">BlockedInterval</div>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--mut);\">Domain model for rendering blocked/unavailable segments on the track with start time, end time, and custom segment color.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">TimeUtils</div>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--mut);\">Utility methods for parsing and formatting time strings (<code>TimeUtils.formatMinutesToTimeString</code>, <code>TimeUtils.parseTimeToMinutes</code>).</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "tags": [
    "Android Library",
    "Material Design",
